---
import type {CollectionEntry} from 'astro:content'
interface Props{entry:CollectionEntry<'demo'>}
const {entry}=Astro.props;const p=entry.data
---
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><a class="case-back" href="/karya">← Semua studi konsep</a><div class="case-labels"><span class="eyebrow">{p.category} / {p.year}</span><span>{p.status}</span></div><h1>{p.title}.</h1><p>{p.description}</p><div class="case-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href={`/demo/preview/${entry.id}`}>Coba live demo ↗</a><a class="button button-secondary" href={`/kontak?demo=${entry.id}`}>Saya ingin website seperti ini →</a></div></div></section>
<section class="container case-visual" style={`--case-accent:${p.accent}`}><div class="desktop-frame"><div class="frame-bar">● ● ● <span>{entry.id}.demo — desktop</span></div><img src={p.image} alt={`Tampilan desktop ${p.title}`} width="1440" height="1000" fetchpriority="high"/></div><div class="mobile-frame"><img src={`/images/previews/${entry.id}-mobile.webp`} alt={`Tampilan mobile ${p.title}`} width="390" height="844" loading="lazy"/></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container case-story"><aside><span class="eyebrow">Project notes</span><dl><dt>Status</dt><dd>Studi konsep, bukan proyek klien</dd><dt>Implementasi</dt><dd>Astro · CSS · TypeScript</dd><dt>Interaksi</dt><dd>Data lokal / simulasi</dd><dt>Fokus</dt><dd>{p.category}</dd></dl></aside><div class="case-chapters"><article><span>01 / Konteks & tantangan</span><h2>{p.challenge}</h2><p>Skenario bisnis ini disusun sebagai eksplorasi desain. Tujuannya menunjukkan bagaimana struktur informasi dan interaksi dapat menjawab kebutuhan pengguna.</p></article><article><span>02 / Pendekatan</span><h2>Pengalaman yang memandu.</h2><p>{p.solution}</p><p>{p.design}</p></article><article><span>03 / Yang dapat Anda coba</span><h2>Detail yang bekerja.</h2><p>{p.interaction}</p><ul>{p.features?.map(f=><li>{f}</li>)}</ul><p class="case-disclaimer">Transaksi, reservasi, pendaftaran, serta angka analitik di demo adalah simulasi. Implementasi produksi dan integrasinya ditentukan melalui lingkup proyek tersendiri.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="case-bottom"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">Your next chapter</span><h2>Punya tantangan<br/>yang serupa?</h2><a class="button button-primary" href={`/kontak?demo=${entry.id}`}>Mari bahas proyek Anda ↗</a></div></section>
<style>.case-back{display:inline-block;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:2.5rem}.case-labels{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:1.4rem;font-size:.7rem}.case-actions{display:flex;gap:.75rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:2rem}.case-visual{position:relative;background:var(--case-accent);padding:4rem 7rem 0;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}.desktop-frame{border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 30px 60px #0003}.frame-bar{background:#f1f0ea;font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.2em;padding:.8rem 1rem;color:#65716b}.frame-bar span{letter-spacing:0;margin-left:2rem}.desktop-frame img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.6;object-fit:cover;object-position:top}.mobile-frame{position:absolute;right:2rem;bottom:-1rem;width:18%;border:6px solid #15271f;border-radius:22px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 15px 40px #0004}.mobile-frame img{display:block;width:100%}.case-story{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 2fr;gap:6rem}.case-story dl{margin-top:2rem;font-size:.85rem}.case-story dt{color:var(--muted);font-size:.7rem;text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:1.5rem}.case-story dd{margin:.4rem 0}.case-chapters article{padding-bottom:3rem;margin-bottom:3rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.case-chapters article>span{font-size:.75rem;color:var(--muted)}.case-chapters h2{font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.5rem);line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:1rem 0 1.5rem}.case-chapters p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem}.case-chapters ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:1.5rem 0}.case-chapters li{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:.8rem 0}.case-chapters li:before{content:'↗';margin-right:1rem}.case-disclaimer{font-size:.8rem}.case-bottom{background:#e4e9d8;padding:5rem 0}.case-bottom h2{font-size:clamp(2.5rem,5vw,5rem);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:1.5rem 0 2rem}@media(max-width:750px){.case-story{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:3rem}.case-visual{padding:2rem 2.5rem 0}.mobile-frame{right:.8rem;width:22%;border-width:3px;border-radius:12px}.case-labels{flex-wrap:wrap}.case-chapters article{margin-bottom:2rem;padding-bottom:2rem}}</style>
